WEBVTT

00:00:47.710 --> 00:00:53.310
If you want to save this cat, 
then bring me a human.

00:00:58.620 --> 00:01:00.870
<i>One life is worth as little as any other.</i>

00:01:01.620 --> 00:01:03.120
<i>And this is only a cat.</i>

00:01:03.880 --> 00:01:07.370
<i>So why do I run? 
Why do I search for a human?</i>

00:01:10.840 --> 00:01:12.880
<i>Is it to save Meowy?</i>

00:01:17.510 --> 00:01:19.780
<i>Such a foolish reason.</i>

00:01:24.430 --> 00:01:26.070
<i>I love blood.</i>

00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:30.440
<i>The taste, the smell, 
the sense of mortality...</i>

00:01:31.570 --> 00:01:35.970
<i>And then... there is something 
I only recently realized:</i>

00:01:37.320 --> 00:01:39.280
<i>The blood is warm...</i>

00:01:40.450 --> 00:01:42.270
<i>And feels pleasant.</i>

00:02:04.600 --> 00:02:06.690
Why did you save me?

00:02:07.710 --> 00:02:09.950
I attempted to kill you.

00:02:22.300 --> 00:02:24.490
Such a foolish reason.

00:02:34.010 --> 00:02:36.050
Forgive my deceit.

00:02:36.460 --> 00:02:38.670
Since Meowy is safe...

00:02:39.540 --> 00:02:41.460
You may fondle my chest.

00:02:51.160 --> 00:02:59.860
Hell <i>yeah</i>!

00:02:59.860 --> 00:03:03.620
Holy shit! Ow!

00:03:04.560 --> 00:03:06.250
That hurts!

00:05:01.600 --> 00:05:02.810
Can you move?

00:05:03.430 --> 00:05:05.280
Not even a finger.

00:05:05.810 --> 00:05:08.030
Take Meowy and flee, please.

00:05:17.710 --> 00:05:20.340
Damn it, not enough chainsaw...

00:05:22.140 --> 00:05:24.010
<i>I must be low on blood.</i>

00:05:27.350 --> 00:05:30.100
And after I finally found him...

00:05:30.760 --> 00:05:34.390
It's you, right? The one who killed Batty.

00:05:34.390 --> 00:05:37.280
He was my man, y'know?!

00:05:39.340 --> 00:05:43.540
Oh... but you're actually 
pretty cute yourself.

00:05:44.150 --> 00:05:47.780
You're my type, so I'll let you go!

00:05:48.810 --> 00:05:50.280
What about them?

00:05:53.520 --> 00:05:54.750
They die.

00:06:00.940 --> 00:06:03.090
Then you can die, too.

00:06:38.120 --> 00:06:40.480
He can fight so fiercely...

00:06:41.920 --> 00:06:43.840
To merely fondle a chest?

00:06:59.580 --> 00:07:01.310
Is this a joke?

00:07:01.310 --> 00:07:05.320
How'd a little pupper 
like you kill my Batty?

00:07:07.820 --> 00:07:13.090
Y'know, he and I shared a dream: 
killing and eating all of humanity.

00:07:13.550 --> 00:07:17.080
A pipe dream, but a noble one, 
and a romantic one.

00:07:17.080 --> 00:07:20.470
And now this little 
yipping dog has ruined it.

00:07:21.150 --> 00:07:23.980
You're cute enough that I regret it...

00:07:24.750 --> 00:07:26.340
But you still need to die.

00:07:28.200 --> 00:07:30.590
I'm not dying before I cop a feel.

00:07:30.590 --> 00:07:32.390
That is ridiculous!

00:07:32.390 --> 00:07:36.060
To think he was killed by someone 
with such a trashy dream.

00:07:36.060 --> 00:07:38.850
Alas, poor Batty...

00:07:40.100 --> 00:07:42.270
<i>Such a foolish reason.</i>

00:07:44.030 --> 00:07:46.190
<i>Everyone is serious about this except you.</i>

00:08:08.730 --> 00:08:13.380
Everybody wants to trash-talk my plans...

00:08:13.380 --> 00:08:14.890
It's revenge this,

00:08:14.890 --> 00:08:16.640
protect my family that,

00:08:16.640 --> 00:08:18.140
and save a cat, too!

00:08:18.140 --> 00:08:20.140
Blah, blah, blah!

00:08:20.140 --> 00:08:23.140
I guess your fancy dreams 
make you guys hot shit, huh?!

00:08:23.140 --> 00:08:26.100
How about we have us a dream battle, then?! 
How about that?!

00:08:26.100 --> 00:08:29.020
If I murderize you,

00:08:29.020 --> 00:08:32.650
that means your dream's 
weaker than fondling a tit!

00:08:32.650 --> 00:08:34.580
Even your howls are cute!

00:08:34.580 --> 00:08:36.860
But y'know what they say about 
little dogs barking! Yap, yap, yap!

00:08:36.860 --> 00:08:40.290
Okay! I'll gobble you up, then!

00:08:41.250 --> 00:08:42.410
Go ahead...

00:08:42.410 --> 00:08:46.900
If you can beat me in the dream battle!

00:09:21.880 --> 00:09:23.540
<i>Demoniacal...</i>

00:10:01.870 --> 00:10:05.120
Time to <i>eat</i>...

00:10:10.970 --> 00:10:11.880
Kon.

00:10:17.940 --> 00:10:20.390
Huh... Huh?

00:10:20.600 --> 00:10:24.890
Looks like she's the Leech Devil. 
May I swallow?

00:10:24.890 --> 00:10:26.020
Do it.

00:10:42.600 --> 00:10:44.830
The Leech Devil's extermination is confirmed.

00:10:45.150 --> 00:10:48.060
I want the rookies handling search 
and rescue, plus assisting with the evac.

00:10:48.060 --> 00:10:49.160
Yes, sir!

00:10:48.060 --> 00:10:49.160
Okay!

00:10:49.160 --> 00:10:52.680
Himeno, you've got seniority, 
so keep watch for more devils.

00:10:52.680 --> 00:10:53.600
On it.

00:10:55.100 --> 00:10:59.050
Dream battle... Gonna... My dream battle...

00:10:59.480 --> 00:11:01.990
You and the Blood Fiend 
need to be debriefed.

00:11:03.300 --> 00:11:04.880
And Meowy?

00:11:10.490 --> 00:11:13.610
Have the cat sent to a veterinarian 
for a thorough checkup.

00:11:27.340 --> 00:11:30.780
I found your arm.

00:11:31.710 --> 00:11:34.080
A blood infusion was all 
it needed to reattach.

00:11:34.810 --> 00:11:36.980
You really are like a devil.

00:11:38.350 --> 00:11:41.340
<i>You</i> seemed pretty friendly 
with that devil back there.

00:11:41.690 --> 00:11:43.230
I saw.

00:11:45.100 --> 00:11:47.220
You really don't know a thing, huh?

00:11:47.600 --> 00:11:51.820
Devil Hunters form contracts with 
devils in order to fight against them.

00:11:53.260 --> 00:11:55.560
I've got a contract with the Fox Devil.

00:11:55.980 --> 00:12:00.600
In exchange for power, 
I offer up a bit of my body as food.

00:12:01.350 --> 00:12:03.280
It was some skin this time.

00:12:04.780 --> 00:12:06.110
Sounds painful.

00:12:07.210 --> 00:12:09.770
Devils yearn for the deaths of humans.

00:12:10.380 --> 00:12:12.540
The same goes for Fiends.

00:12:14.020 --> 00:12:16.420
Power seems cool, though.

00:12:19.090 --> 00:12:23.890
The surveillance cameras caught 
you two headed to your patrol area.

00:12:22.170 --> 00:12:24.930
Paused

00:12:24.220 --> 00:12:29.060
And the house that we believe 
was housing the Bat Devil

00:12:29.060 --> 00:12:31.220
contained a lot of your spilt blood.

00:12:32.170 --> 00:12:35.500
The Blood Fiend tried to kill you, didn't she?

00:12:36.340 --> 00:12:41.110
I don't know why, but you're trying 
to protect a devil. Again.

00:12:41.600 --> 00:12:44.860
I dunno... <i>is</i> that how it happened?

00:12:48.410 --> 00:12:52.180
My daughter would like 
to meet the chainsaw guy.

00:12:52.180 --> 00:12:53.510
Thank you.

00:12:54.130 --> 00:12:58.060
The devil threatened to eat 
me back at the office,

00:12:58.060 --> 00:13:00.600
but now that I think about it, he was 
wearing a Public Safety uniform.

00:13:00.600 --> 00:13:02.190
I'd like to thank him.

00:13:02.930 --> 00:13:05.240
"Don't give a shit about 
saving some dude," he says!

00:13:05.240 --> 00:13:07.360
And then the devil throws 
my car with me in it!

00:13:07.360 --> 00:13:09.590
It was a devil with a chainsaw 
coming out of its head...

00:13:13.210 --> 00:13:16.640
If I dig deeper into this, 
and report it to the higher-ups,

00:13:16.640 --> 00:13:20.140
it'd mean the Blood Fiend gets disposed of
 along with you, since you covered for her.

00:13:20.900 --> 00:13:22.900
But there were no fatalities.

00:13:23.210 --> 00:13:27.410
So, if you're willing to accept one condition, 
I'll let what happened slide.

00:13:32.190 --> 00:13:34.590
You need to do what I tell you to.

00:13:35.390 --> 00:13:38.170
You're a dumbass and a brat 
with no clue about right and wrong.

00:13:38.480 --> 00:13:42.580
I've been doing this longer, so I'm pretty
 sure I have some grasp of social ethics.

00:13:43.160 --> 00:13:47.430
All you need to do to protect 
this lifestyle is listen to me.

00:13:50.260 --> 00:13:52.930
How about it? If you follow, 
I want an answer.

00:13:55.440 --> 00:13:58.440
Sure. I'll keep it in mind.

00:14:00.010 --> 00:14:01.600
You can relax.

00:14:01.940 --> 00:14:05.410
I might not be after some 
big-deal goal like you guys,

00:14:05.410 --> 00:14:07.930
and I might dream small.

00:14:08.600 --> 00:14:12.700
But I'm as serious about this as you are.

00:14:13.280 --> 00:14:15.510
You can count on me.

00:14:19.650 --> 00:14:22.210
Try and learn some manners in the meantime.

00:14:22.530 --> 00:14:25.680
Yeah, I'll think about it.

00:14:32.040 --> 00:14:34.530
You see? Am I not innocent?

00:14:37.420 --> 00:14:40.480
Now, would you kindly take these off?

00:14:40.480 --> 00:14:43.120
Is this a good idea?

00:14:43.120 --> 00:14:46.400
When this cutie-Fiend kills somebody,

00:14:46.400 --> 00:14:49.240
it's gonna be your responsibility, 
for letting her live.

00:14:49.240 --> 00:14:51.840
We're Devil Hunters.

00:14:51.840 --> 00:14:53.630
Whether they're devils or Fiends,

00:14:53.630 --> 00:14:55.940
if they're handy, 
we should put them to work.

00:14:56.800 --> 00:15:00.120
But they're still the enemy. 
We're just making use of them.

00:15:01.200 --> 00:15:03.370
We're not making friends.

00:15:35.800 --> 00:15:36.740
Come in.

00:15:37.320 --> 00:15:38.510
Excuse me.

00:15:46.940 --> 00:15:51.190
And he claims they "were outside 
the patrol zone before they knew it,"

00:15:51.880 --> 00:15:55.710
and that they discovered a house that
"looked like it had a super-nasty devil in it,"

00:15:55.710 --> 00:15:58.240
which is where they encountered 
the Bat Devil.

00:15:58.920 --> 00:16:02.270
Denji used his chainsaws to
 exterminate the Bat Devil,

00:16:02.270 --> 00:16:05.180
and then came under attack 
by the Leech Devil...

00:16:05.180 --> 00:16:07.610
Which Division 4 exterminated.

00:16:08.030 --> 00:16:12.740
There were no traces of Gun flesh 
in either the Bat or Leech Devil's heads.

00:16:13.050 --> 00:16:14.580
That concludes my report.

00:16:17.560 --> 00:16:18.900
Well done.

00:16:19.550 --> 00:16:26.880
But Denji and Power managed to get awfully 
far without anyone noticing, didn't they?

00:16:27.270 --> 00:16:30.130
I'd chalk that up to them 
being unbelievably stupid.

00:16:30.130 --> 00:16:34.500
Leaving the approved area 
is against regulations.

00:16:34.880 --> 00:16:37.340
Considering there were no fatalities,

00:16:37.340 --> 00:16:42.060
and that we were able to get rid of 
two devils, I think it's worth overlooking.

00:16:47.720 --> 00:16:49.270
Understood.

00:16:49.770 --> 00:16:51.880
If you'll excuse me, ma'am.

00:16:53.180 --> 00:16:56.570
You seem a little more 
flexible now, Hayakawa.

00:16:57.780 --> 00:17:01.640
Is that Denji's influence, I wonder?

00:17:02.400 --> 00:17:03.350
I doubt it.

00:17:04.230 --> 00:17:07.370
I haven't changed at all.

00:18:38.340 --> 00:18:41.260
How's he up so early?

00:19:07.530 --> 00:19:08.980
What's for lunch?

00:19:09.700 --> 00:19:10.620
Curry.

00:19:11.000 --> 00:19:11.980
Sweet!

00:19:15.540 --> 00:19:18.010
The hell's this? A devil?

00:19:25.010 --> 00:19:27.920
What a pitiful home this is!

00:19:31.270 --> 00:19:35.880
I'd like you to put Power up 
in one of your rooms, Hayakawa.

00:19:36.270 --> 00:19:41.280
I think you'll make a good leash 
for the two of them.

00:19:41.280 --> 00:19:43.940
Stop right there, Meowy!

00:19:41.280 --> 00:19:44.910
Is there some reason why you're sending
 me all these psychos, ma'am?

00:19:44.910 --> 00:19:47.210
It seems you've got quite a feast!

00:19:44.910 --> 00:19:49.410
It's because I trust you 
more than anyone else.

00:19:47.210 --> 00:19:49.410
Damn it, who said you could come in?!

00:19:49.410 --> 00:19:50.520
'Tis mine now!

00:19:50.520 --> 00:19:52.670
Gimme my super toast back!

00:19:53.220 --> 00:19:55.420
Oh... okay.

00:19:55.780 --> 00:19:58.750
It'd be a little odd to have her 
staying at the office indefinitely.

00:20:02.400 --> 00:20:03.420
Okay.

00:20:04.570 --> 00:20:09.370
You don't need to worry. 
Power said she would behave.

00:20:10.010 --> 00:20:11.310
It'll be fine.

00:20:13.690 --> 00:20:15.290
Vegetables are revolting!

00:20:15.290 --> 00:20:16.040
Away!

00:20:16.430 --> 00:20:17.390
Carrot!

00:20:18.400 --> 00:20:19.970
Don't fling your vegetables!

00:20:19.970 --> 00:20:21.080
Damn it...

00:20:21.080 --> 00:20:25.360
Show some respect to the farmers 
who grew the veggies, devil!

00:20:27.090 --> 00:20:28.200
The toilet?

00:20:28.480 --> 00:20:30.830
I prefer to only occasionally 
flush my feces.

00:20:30.830 --> 00:20:32.050
Flush it!

00:20:32.050 --> 00:20:33.460
It stinks.

00:20:33.760 --> 00:20:35.670
I prefer to only occasionally bathe.

00:20:35.670 --> 00:20:36.870
Get in there!

00:20:36.870 --> 00:20:38.340
You reek!

00:20:38.340 --> 00:20:40.500
You two are absurd.

00:20:40.500 --> 00:20:42.970
How delicate these humans be.

00:20:42.970 --> 00:20:44.340
Aren't they, Meowy?

00:20:53.850 --> 00:20:57.360
Can't believe she just shows up 
and starts raising hell.

00:20:57.360 --> 00:21:00.110
Do devils not flush the toilet?

00:21:00.110 --> 00:21:02.220
Didn't eat her veggies either.

00:21:02.220 --> 00:21:03.610
You there...

00:21:04.610 --> 00:21:09.370
Hey, Shit Devil! Your turds are stuck 
to the damn toilet and won't come off!

00:21:16.120 --> 00:21:18.090
We had a deal, did we not?

00:21:18.090 --> 00:21:20.290
You may fondle my chest.

00:21:20.620 --> 00:21:21.630
So, fondle!

00:21:37.610 --> 00:21:40.690
Come now, what's the matter? 
Aren't you pleased?

00:21:40.690 --> 00:21:42.230
Commence your fondling.

00:21:47.730 --> 00:21:49.490
I have stipulations, however.

00:21:50.670 --> 00:21:54.120
You have earned three squeezes of my breast.

00:21:54.710 --> 00:21:56.070
Three?

00:21:56.980 --> 00:21:59.320
One for your rescue of Meowy.

00:21:59.640 --> 00:22:02.100
A second for slaying the Bat Devil.

00:22:02.480 --> 00:22:06.660
And a third for protecting me from topknot!

00:22:07.400 --> 00:22:09.970
I had no intention of actually letting you,

00:22:10.280 --> 00:22:13.470
but your efforts have earned 
you these three squeezes.

00:22:13.470 --> 00:22:15.440
Squeeze them gratefully.

00:22:22.780 --> 00:22:24.190
She's an angel!

00:22:25.780 --> 00:22:27.990
<b>BLAAAARGH!</b>

00:23:15.580 --> 00:23:17.450
<b>Lalalalah</b>

00:23:42.900 --> 00:23:43.900
<b>BLAAAARGH!</b>

00:23:49.820 --> 00:23:50.110
<b>Denji,
Hear Me Out</b>
